{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678","id":3788803176,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc676RKX","number":114678,"title":"Make directional lights' tighter shadow caster culling truly tight (implement per-cascade culling)","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":19,"created_at":"2026-01-07T13:35:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T09:33:48Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T00:09:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-04T00:09:30Z"},"body":"This PR fixes errors in the implementation of tight shadowcaster culling for directional lights, and implements tight per-cascade culling for directional lights.\r\n\r\nI have not performed strict performance benchmarks, but have observed improved GPU times in my own project, and I believe that benchmarking aside, the shadowmaps speak for themselves:\r\n\r\nbest-case scenario 4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"4 5-stable-best\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6b2e47f-2d6a-4b43-a4b4-28836c921596\" />\r\n\r\nbest-case scenario PR:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"pr-best\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3d84680-d2bd-4b53-87d0-f50b63e43684\" />\r\n\r\nworst-case scenario 4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"4 5-stable-worst\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f33ffeb-1b37-4b8f-9c05-3deb459f2aa4\" />\r\n\r\nworst-case scenario PR:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"pr-worst\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15b8d541-0713-4e83-80be-151d0107fced\" />\r\n\r\nTests were done with this MRP: [shadow_cull_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24472116/shadow_cull_mrp.zip)\r\n\r\nThe plane in the MRP is intentionally made to only receive and not cast shadows so that the cubes are more easily visible in the shadowmaps.\r\n\r\nI have already tested 4, 2, and 1 split directional shadows and they should all work correctly.\r\n\r\nThere should be no visual changes introduced by this PR, as this PR should only improve performance while maintaining the same visuals. So far I've fixed any visual issues I've found and everything should work fine, but more subtle edge cases might've slipped by without me noticing, so some extra tests that everything is working fine are welcome. Do your worst :P\r\n\r\nWorth noting that despite what the shadowmaps of 4.5-stable seem to imply, there was actually no previous implementation of tight per-cascade culling. Previous directional tight culling only culled around the camera's view frustum and *not* the actual cascades' visibility ranges; then another separate per-cascade AABB culling is performed, which is separate from tight culling, and is why it *looks* like there is tight per-cascade culling, even though there actually wasn't.\r\n\r\nNote to reviewers: [I've pointed this out in the code](https://github.com/Image-unavailable/godot/blob/95ab1726e928a4561906fc2c79dfdab3786c8a90/servers/rendering/rendering_light_culler.h#L207), but I'm not sure whether the `_is_colinear_tri` function actually does anything useful. It might be worth removing (minimal performance gains?), but I don't know if it's there for some particular reason or whatnot, since lawnjelly must've added it for some reason (even though it backfired due to too-high thresholds causing many false-positives). Then again I did have occasional engine freezes while working on this PR with it disabled among other changes (idk if removing `_is_colinear_tri` caused them though), so maybe it's better to leave it there...\r\n\r\n*This PR's name is a reference to lawnjelly's original \"tighter shadow caster culling\" #84745 PR.*","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":12,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114678/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}